                "stats-run.json: group 0 time=493.146, group 1 time=354.29",
                "manuscript.md: results list both without comment"
              ],
              "whyItMatters": "Comparing survival at different follow-up times is invalid. The reported 0.0000 for group 1 at time 354.29 versus 0.3672 for group 0 at time 493.146 is misleading because the times differ, and group 1 may have had no subjects left, but the time indicates possibly all events occurred earlier, yet that cannot be compared directly to a later time in group 0.",
              "actionableFix": "Report survival at a common clinically relevant time point (e.g., 1 year, median follow-up) or present the full survival curves and estimate differences at multiple time points with CIs.",
              "reentryPoint": "execution",
              "deterministicVerification": "The two extracted time points are not equal.",
              "confidence": 0.98
            },
            {
              "id": "F5",
